IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MCP-SERVER-SIM.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT MCP-STDIN ASSIGN TO SYSIN.
    SELECT MCP-STDOUT ASSIGN TO SYSOUT.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  MCP-STDIN.
01  IN-RECORD          PIC X(255).
FD  MCP-STDOUT.
01  OUT-RECORD         PIC X(255).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-COMMAND          PIC X(50).
01  WS-STATUS           PIC X(20).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "MCP SERVER SIMULATION STARTING..." AT SYSOUT.
    READ MCP-STDIN.
    IF IN-RECORD(1:6) = "method" THEN
        MOVE "OK" TO WS-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE "ERROR" TO WS-STATUS
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY "STATUS: " WS-STATUS AT SYSOUT.
    DISPLAY "RECEIVED: " IN-RECORD AT SYSOUT.
    STOP RUN.